title: metarecord:create
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Create a new metarecord

Creates a metarecord at once and selects it, in [[metarecord-detail panel]]. It asks for a schema type, whose template fields are filled in; left blank, the metarecord is empty. A type the schema does not declare is refused ([[Schema]]).
